Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon word processor
 Folio Page is a word processor with a ribbon interface, .docx as its native
 format, and an engine of its own: it reads and writes the format directly,
 lays pages out the way Word does, and draws them without a toolkit under it.
 Styles, tables, pictures, shapes, charts, headers and footers, footnotes, a
 contents list, captions and cross-references, comments and tracked changes,
 spelling, mail merge and a ruler. It prints, and exports PDFs with the fonts
 embedded and the words still searchable. Everything stays on this computer.
